00:39:06.036 --> 00:39:13.036
I don't know, I don't know, I don't know. But I want to tell you that the Teshuva of Rambam, the Teshuva of Rambam, that says...

00:39:13.036 --> 00:39:16.036
It's all she left him and she left him and he's heartbroken.

00:39:16.036 --> 00:39:27.036
But if a person is in a bed, in a depressed mood or whatever it is, the Teshuva of Rambam says you're permitted to listen to music.

00:39:27.036 --> 00:39:33.036
You're permitted to listen to music because this is, you're not doing it for euphoria, you're doing it just to...

00:39:33.036 --> 00:39:34.036
Psychological.

00:39:34.036 --> 00:39:41.036
