00:39:49.036 --> 00:39:52.036
Rabbi, you told us you're going to worship Hashem. What do you, and you want to...

00:39:56.036 --> 00:40:00.056
I'm bathing, I'm relaxing my mind and all of a sudden I'm able to...

00:40:00.000 --> 00:40:06.000
Sometimes you go to the center, you go there, you're on line. No, no, this is true.

00:40:06.000 --> 00:40:12.000
Or it's the same thing with music. If you use music to expand, that's what Rambam says.

00:40:12.000 --> 00:40:14.000
That's what Rambam wants us to do.

00:40:14.000 --> 00:40:16.000
