And he called me, said, Rava, he said that this kind of cheese is permitted. And I told him, listen, the truth is that it's not permitted. Now, you want to eat it, eat it. Now, there's two ways how to eat the cheese. One way to eat it is, listen, I know it's haram, but I'm eating it. If you know it's haram, one day you make teshuvah. But if you're going to say to people, no, this cheese, no, this, this, this, never make teshuvah. So my opinion is like this. We try to observe as much as we can.

